  "id": "body-ideal",
  "term": "body ideal",
  "definition": "Body ideal is the body shape or composition a person sees as the one they would ideally like to have. In this packet, it refers especially to a culturally shared appearance standard that people may internalize, such as preferring more muscle and less body fat, and it often serves as the comparison point for judging one’s current body.",
